# Flick a Coin ({2}{R}): "deals 1 damage to any target. You create a Treasure token. Draw a card." (CR 120.3, 111.4, 121.1). Aimed
# at Bot2's face it deals exactly 1, Bot1 (the caster, not the target) gets the Treasure and draws: of seven cards in hand,
# the Lotus and the Flick are played, leaving five, and the draw makes six. Bot2 gets neither the Treasure nor the card.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Flick a Coin
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Flick a Coin.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
? Bot1.Battlefield = Treasure Token

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Treasure Token.Token = true
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Graveyard = Flick a Coin; Black Lotus
